# Committed baseline of the DNA hashes currently INSTALLED on the fleet.
#
# Format: <role>=<uhC0k… DNA hash>, one per line, blank lines and `#` comments
# ignored. `role` matches the happ.yaml role name (elohim/workdir/happ.yaml),
# not the DNA directory name (node-registry dir -> node_registry role).
#
# Read and enforced by scripts/ci/dna-hash-guard.sh in the "Build DNA" stage
# of elohim/holochain/dna/Jenkinsfile: a build whose packed DNA hash diverges
# from this file fails the build (INTEGRITY-HASH-MOVED) unless the triggering
# commit message carries `[dna:migrate]` — see the incident this guards
# against: commit 03f331f21 (2026-09-02) moved all five INTEGRITY wasm hashes
# via an unconditional linker-flag change believed hash-neutral, uninstalling
# the fleet's hApp and tearing every source chain.
#
# Update this file in the SAME commit as any change that is meant to move a
# DNA hash, and tag that commit `[dna:migrate]`.
